  "id": "dheed-cube",
  "stac_version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "DHEED (Dry and Hot Extreme Events Database) provides a global inventory of compound dry and hot climate extremes from 1950–2023 derived from ERA5 reanalysis data. The collection includes an EventCube of discrete extreme occurrences and a LabelCube of connected spatiotemporal events in zarr format with a table of event statistics describing their extent, duration, intensity, and affected area.",
